        "original_id": "bd62f909-af89-5182-8d0b-d7f5945b7d80",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Events: 2015 Africa Magic Viewers Choice Awards\n- Places: Lagos, Eko Hotel and Suites, Victoria Island, Lagos Lagoon, Atlantic Ocean, Bar Beach\n- People: Femi Jacobs\n- Topics: Port city geography, barrier islands, local government areas\n\nFacts:\n- The 2015 Africa Magic Viewers Choice Awards was held on March 7, 2015 at the Eko Hotel and Suites in Victoria Island, Lagos, Nigeria.\n- Femi Jacobs won the award for Best Actor in a Comedy at the 2015 Africa Magic Viewers Choice Awards.\n- Lagos initially emerged as a port city on a collection of islands in the present-day local government areas of Lagos Island, Eti-Osa, Amuwo-Odofin, and Apapa.\n- The islands of Lagos are separated by creeks at the southwest mouth of Lagos Lagoon.\n- Barrier islands and long sand spits such as Bar Beach protect Lagos from the Atlantic Ocean, stretching up to 100 km east and west of the lagoon mouth.",
